  "notes": [
    "Past gradient probe showed no persistent local suppression,not absence of cumulative anchoring. This is a bounded causal coefficient test,not an assumption that removing regularization helps. Coef0.01 keeps the identical reference-model initialization/diagnostic path in both arms. No Slumbot games or benchmark-specific action rules.",
    "Exact two-arm configuration and physical-accounting tests passed14. Admission now requires at leastone positive Bonferroni-adjusted primary lower bound,not a merely nominal interval. Snapshot and sequential training/evaluation wrapper starting; no Slumbot calls in this experiment.",
    "Full execution snapshot frozen before both arms. Same source/deal seeds/collection/physical budgets; only source-KL coefficient and output identity differ. No live source edits allowed during this wrapper.",
    "Both preregistered final physical endpoints frozen by budget only; original source hash unchanged. Starting fixed independent sampled evaluation.",
    "Both frozen endpoints evaluated against source and matched source-KL control on independent seed. Complete raw evidence and independent CI recomputation passed. Inspect numerical/Adam health and result before finish; no claim of Slumbot success.",
    "Original wrapper is terminal before merging supplemental review provenance. Deferred PENDING label is retained as original intent; merged metric establishes completion. No training or evaluation hands were added by offline tests/review.",
    "Prepared independently computed two-pass raw paired statistics and strict Bonferroni gate review while the unchanged original control trainer was live. Existing training/evaluation scripts and frozen source snapshots were not edited.",
    "Fourteen synthetic report tests passed,including full report generation with actual torch checkpoint deserialization, script hashing, exact Adam partial-step accounting, scalar coefficient enforcement and refusal to overwrite. These fixtures are not poker evidence; zero actual training/evaluation hands.",
    "Defer experiment_log writes until the original wrapper exits,so only that wrapper updates the shared RUNNING record during production. The original evaluator still controls the fixed untouched matrix and registered admission rule.",
    "Before any matrix outcome,read primary AlphaHoldem and NashPG papers; verified the latest NashPG v3 dated2026-08-03 and its current official repository. Saved a conditional next-direction memo distinguishing fixed KL(reference||current) here from refreshed KL(current||reference),with no claim that practical NashPG has exact convergence or200bb Slumbot success. No upstream code was installed or executed.",
    "Extended only uncaptured postprocessing with raw_cell_review.py before the weak arm or matrix outcomes. Independently recomputes pair/seat means, sample variances, CI widths, totals, outcome counts and aggregate OOD validity from decision/node counts at frozen default threshold0.15. No admission-rule change. Current revision passes27synthetic tests; prior14-test XML retained. Synthetic tests add zero poker hands. OOD aggregate consistency is not a new per-action trace audit.",
    "Read-only integration check of the new raw-cell postprocessor passed all9existing cells from the completed large-batch pilot. No historical evidence was edited, no games rerun, and none of those prior hands are added to this experiment accounting.",
    "During the weak arm and before any matrix outcome,read current official NashPG source pinned to GitHub main SHA dda50fe112f2d5bbbc46af33c8f1550e0177cc29. Saved conditional source-contract notes: direct KL(current||reference), both-seat current-policy training, post-inner-round reference refresh, and upstream agent-only checkpoint API are not a lossless learner resume. Repository defaults differ from some paper settings; do not silently mix them. No upstream code installed/executed and no current training source modified. These are prospective mechanics, not a new experiment, statistical result, or override of the registered branch.",
    "Post-close audit has one lexical false positive: the exact executed read-only python -c integration check contains dictionary-comprehension braces that COMMAND_PLACEHOLDER_RE treats as placeholders. Preserve its original exact command and deferred provenance rather than remove history to force a green audit. All80records validate; the other11recent records have zero warnings. This warning is unrelated to raw hands, source/model hashes, statistics or optimizer evidence."
  ],
